  "project_description": "SoundCloud Field provides a field for inserting a SoundCloud track or set into your content.\n\n Features:\n\n - Configurable player\n\n - 2 player types: Classic or Visual player\n\n - Embed code can be loaded server-side or via Javascript.\n\n When displaying multiple tracks on a single page via Views, use Javascript to embed the player. This will limit the amount of server-side calls that are required and vastly improve the page load time.",
